# SQL migrations are FORWARD-ONLY and immutable once merged (CLAUDE.md #4).
# Prettier does not format .sql anyway, but making the intent explicit means
# nobody later adds a plugin that quietly rewrites a merged migration.
supabase/migrations/

# Markdown is hand-wrapped here, and deliberately.
#
# Running Prettier over the docs rewrote 37 files and ~1,300 lines — reflowing
# paragraphs and turning every *emphasis* into _emphasis_ — for no readability
# gain, while burying any real edit in churn. `momoAPIs.md` alone moved 133
# lines, and that is the file CLAUDE.md #9 forbids coding against from memory;
# the last thing it needs is a diff nobody can read.
#
# Prose is reviewed by people. Code is reviewed by people and by machines, and
# only the code half gets anything from a formatter.
*.md
